{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into this captivating 2D pixel art retro platformer and enter a world where speed and precision determine your success. With a total of 60 levels spread across 4 diverse worlds, you'll experience fast-paced single-screen action: collect all the gold coins, master treacherous traps, and overcome dangerous obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Highlights:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>60 Challenging Levels:</strong> Each world features 20 unique levels that will test your speedrunner spirit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retro Pixel Art:</strong> A lovingly crafted aesthetic that reinterprets classic platformer action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Precise Platforming:</strong> React in a flash to traps and obstacles in single-screen level designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Steam Achievements:</strong> Earn achievements and prove your skills in exciting challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Epic Final Boss:</strong> Confront the ultimate enemy in a battle that decides the fate of a family.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an adventure full of heart, action, and nostalgia\u2014and let yourself be captivated by <strong>Little Betty: Gold Rush</strong>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3470940?t=1745930445","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470940/bab28fbbd60d468f828d6c04a8386e2ff451612e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745930445","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470940/25931f6f00207e1cfe7734d003c64e95aac9666a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745930445","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470940/25931f6f00207e1cfe7734d003c64e95aac9666a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745930445","categor